From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since23 path=A chunked 0x45 + TSP reset

since22 sent 0x30 despite need_*=0; APP_CONFIG in td4150_a12s_boe.bin is
really 4096 (not a PAGE_SIZE cap of 45568). firmware_status 10 00 has
no need_app_code/need_firmware/need_reset bits.

write_message does not disable_irq (irq_en=1 at timeout). SPI write
returns success. Idle-ATTN commands time out because on-chip 0x02 after
a wrapped 0x45 is an HDL stub: ROMBOOT_APP_CODE 97280+14 sent as one
TCM frame whose u16 length wrapped (97294 & 0xffff = 31758).

since23 path=A:
- Chunk 0x45 to PAGE_SIZE, 16-byte aligned; log spi rc / irq_en / gpio
  at command start.
- Do not skip HDL when 0x45 completes via IDENTIFY 0x02.
- If 0x45 failed: pulse TSP reset (DT reset-gpio, else gpio_lcd_rst)
  once and retry. Do not blindly repeat the same unchunked 0x45.
- 0x30 only when need_* bits ask for config. Log blob_len vs filesize.
- Keep: no ENABLE_REPORT 0x05, no do_polling, no SPI read when ATTN idle,
  no wait=0 0x30 from IRQ.

Applies after syna-tcm-hdl-send-0x30.patch.

